Regenerate `landing/prompts/catalog.generated.js`.

Extend `tests/unit/landing/test_landing_quickstarts.py` with gates
that fail if the prompt catalog drifts from the runtime registry:
  - generated platform ids equal every registry platform id with SQL
    or DataFrame support;
  - every generated platform has a non-empty label, at least one
    interface, and at least one deployment;
  - every generated deployment value is one of `local`,
    `self-hosted`, or `managed`;
  - any non-UI registry deployment mode such as `remote` has an
    explicit generator mapping covered by test;
  - SQL filter pool contains all SQL-capable registry platforms for
    the selected deployment;
  - DataFrame filter pool contains all DataFrame-capable registry
    platforms for the selected deployment;
  - managed platform entries have effective safety terms;
  - no hand-curated subset comment remains.
